Fuyao Photos, original Android implementation, 2026.

Project conventions and documentation structure were inspected in the local
FuyaoColorPicker and FuyaoLocale projects owned by skyrocketingHong.
Build-number allocation, APK naming, system-bar handling and UI token patterns are adapted
from FuyaoLocale and FuyaoColorPicker (AGPL-3.0-only).

Color sampling, conversion, CSS reference colors and RAL reference tables are
adapted from FuyaoColorPicker, Copyright (C) 2026 skyrocketingHong:
https://github.com/skyrocketingHong/FuyaoColorPicker
The Apple implementation ports these functions to native Swift and Core Image.
FuyaoColorPicker is a substantial rewrite based on the behavior and reference
data of Color Picker 3.1 (com.nauj27.android.colorpicker, versionCode 20130326),
historically hosted at https://code.google.com/p/colorpicker/.
Material derived from or reconstructed from that GPL-3.0-only baseline,
including applicable RAL reference data, retains the upstream license and
attribution. See LICENSES/ColorPicker-GPL-3.0.txt. RAL values are approximate
reference RGB values, not a licensed physical color measurement standard.

The style follows measurements taken from five local reference screenshots.
These measurements are independent estimates, not official Apple specifications.

