BeetMan/XDRemux-Flutter, revision 747ad8f, and its predecessor 21Z121Z1/XDRemux.
The upstream source is MIT licensed; its license is retained at
third_party/XDRemux-Flutter/LICENSE. The application uses its own Kotlin and Swift
implementations rather than bundling upstream Flutter or Rust binaries.
https://github.com/BeetMan/XDRemux-Flutter

