Vendored x265
--------------
The Android app embeds the x265 video encoder (source vendored under
android/app/src/main/cpp/x265, upstream: multicoreware x265, X265_BUILD 216).
x265 is free software licensed under the GNU General Public License version 2
or, at your option, any later version (see COPYING in the vendored tree). The
combined work remains distributable under this project's AGPL-3.0-only license
because GPL-2.0-or-later is one-way compatible with AGPL-3.0. Binaries carry
the x265 static library; the complete corresponding source lives in this
repository.

